            "review_title": "Review at Family Kitchen & Café",
            "review_text": "A_D_07\nSingapore, Singapore21 contributions\n0\nMemorable dinner at Family Kitchen & Cafe Sapa\nJun 2026 • Family\nI discovered Family Kitchen & Cafe using AI recommendation while on holiday in Sapa. I was with my family and we had a great time here. Kids loved the pasta made using fresh local ingredients and Hmong specialities.. it was yummy! We also had the locally made Plum Wine, it was so good! The owner (Caoyung) made the experience memorable for us by looking after us and sharing some of her experiences. She has decorated the restaurant tastefully and you will see some items there that the current generation may not relate to ;-) The young one loved interacting with the two pet dogs who were well behaved and adorable! We also recommend the Banh Mi and the pumpkin soup, it was very nice. Hope to be back again in the future. :-)\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nTake note of the steep steps leading to the restaurant, wear shoes with a good grip\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 4, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
