            "review_text": "LPeZ\nCanberra, Australia9 contributions\n0\nOur favourite meal in viet to date!\nSep 2025 • Couples\nIt was pouring rain and we stumbled upon this restaurant. They had a warm dry quaint room filled with satisfied looking customers so we said YES. And ohhhh my gosh! Our favourite meal in Vietnam to date! They had a wide menu, which we often as sceptical about. But everything we had was mind blowing delicious and flavoursome. We have the spring rolls with peanut sauce, noodles with local veg,chicken banh mi and a chicken coconut curry. For simple meals, they were packed with flavour and depth. The staff were so attentive and it was just a beautiful space. There are some stairs up to restaurant, but with the hand rail - it is worth it !!\nRead more\nWritten October 3, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
