            "review_text": "@Asian_Views70üp my\nNew York City, New York15 contributions\n0\nReally great food in Sapa\nSep 2025 • Couples\nFirst of all, I do not know what happened with the location pin here, but the place is definitely in Sapa. And it has steep stairs, which we stumbled up rather by accident. It felt very family like indeed and we weren’t sure if it’s a great idea to have dinner here. But the food was fantastic, the coconut curry was short of spectacular with a creamy rich coconut sauce and nice mix of veggies, chicken and herbs. The fresh spring rolls were also very tasty as was my fresh passion fruit juice. I highly recommend this place.\nRead more\nWritten September 4, 2025",
